# Per-biome terrain graph clones. Vista clones the authored graph once per
# spawned LPB and names it <BiomeName>_<GraphName>, so the set changes with the
# seed (Mountain_1_* only exists when two massifs spawn) and every bake rewrites
# them. The authored originals next to them stay tracked.
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/IslandBase_*_TerrainGraph.asset
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/IslandBase_*_TerrainGraph.asset.meta
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/Mountain_*_TerrainGraph.asset
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/Mountain_*_TerrainGraph.asset.meta
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/SeaFloor_SeaFloor_TerrainGraph.asset
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/SeaFloor_SeaFloor_TerrainGraph.asset.meta

# Diagnostic output, written by the Dump menus outside Assets on purpose so the
