*.bak

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Code-generated assets: fully determined by source, nothing to author in them.
# Rebuilt by Create/Recreate Vegetation Templates and the player setup menu.
# The create-if-missing assets beside these stay tracked on purpose -- biome
# template prefabs, terrain graphs, terrain layers and the tree/detail
# templates carry Inspector tuning that code seeds once and must never restamp,
# so ignoring them would silently reset a world to code defaults on clone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/Vegetation/Overworld_GrassDetail.prefab
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/Vegetation/Overworld_GrassDetail.prefab.meta
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/Vegetation/Overworld_GrassDetail.mat
unity/Assets/Settings/Vista/Vegetation/Overworld_GrassDetail.mat.meta
